{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, long time no see! I've started eating healthier - what's new with you? Picked up any new hobbies?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-ed05175708d5d600a3e9baa3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.130573+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ed05175708d5d600a3e9baa3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ed05175708d5d600a3e9baa3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam! That's awesome about your healthier eating! For me, I had a setback last week - messed up my knee playing b-ball with the kids. It's been tough to stay active since. I really miss going on adventures like we did last year - good times with the family!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-fd7f4657bd58fc470e2c060a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.184750+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fd7f4657bd58fc470e2c060a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fd7f4657bd58fc470e2c060a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, sorry to hear about your knee. It must be tough. Are there any ways to stay active while you heal up?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-9c1e2122072566de0f0bf754", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.215306+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c1e2122072566de0f0bf754", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c1e2122072566de0f0bf754", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam. PT has helped some. I can't do intense workouts, but I'm doing easy exercises to keep it strong. Not as good as being active outdoors, but still something."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-ee9b8f4102fd724c55e6cfe7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.238485+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ee9b8f4102fd724c55e6cfe7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ee9b8f4102fd724c55e6cfe7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Glad PT is helping, Evan! Taking care of yourself is key \u2013 have you explored any fun indoor activities or hobbies?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-50a641024f9a50a1dd4f3172", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.261489+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "50a641024f9a50a1dd4f3172", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "50a641024f9a50a1dd4f3172", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I do my favorite watercolor painting to keep me busy. It's a chill way to relax and get into the colors. By the way, something happened two weeks ago! You're not gonna believe this, I had a bit of an adventure recently. Helped a lost tourist find their way, and we ended up taking an unexpected tour around the city. It was a blast!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-5ceb1ee4cb5e17a9dc77a24d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.282403+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5ceb1ee4cb5e17a9dc77a24d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5ceb1ee4cb5e17a9dc77a24d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, that sounds like a fun and unexpected event! It's always interesting how helping someone can turn into a little adventure of its own. And how's your watercolor painting going?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-2beeb567066970ced81a871b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.320421+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2beeb567066970ced81a871b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2beeb567066970ced81a871b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It's been great! I find painting to be a great stress reliever. Here's what I did last week."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-bddb6d57696ad8fe044cf11f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.340927+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bddb6d57696ad8fe044cf11f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bddb6d57696ad8fe044cf11f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, those are awesome! So cool. Where did you get the inspiration for them?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-54dc8c6770c4221dc2a976c8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.359930+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54dc8c6770c4221dc2a976c8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54dc8c6770c4221dc2a976c8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam! The sunset painting was inspired by a vacation a few years back. The colors were so stunning. The cactus painting came from a road trip last month. Such cool places!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-f8829fc28551810e988dcddf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.381441+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f8829fc28551810e988dcddf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f8829fc28551810e988dcddf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, Evan, your paintings are awesome! How do you decide what to paint?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-7848ddc814f556edee0a0997", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.413015+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7848ddc814f556edee0a0997", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7848ddc814f556edee0a0997", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam! I usually paint what's on my mind or something I'm feeling. It can be good memories or places I wanna go to. It's more like expressing myself through art."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-32d42d57bde5548230fd3271", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.436031+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "32d42d57bde5548230fd3271", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "32d42d57bde5548230fd3271", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's really amazing, Evan. Expressing yourself through art is such a powerful form of self-expression."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-58738f78d059ca37f7f55420", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.462038+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "58738f78d059ca37f7f55420", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "58738f78d059ca37f7f55420", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam. Yeah, it's really a great way to express myself and my emotions. It's a cool way to communicate without using words. So, do you have any other ways in which you express yourself?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-aa7318d2368faeb8a4c8b19d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.485545+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa7318d2368faeb8a4c8b19d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa7318d2368faeb8a4c8b19d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Drawing is cool. I'm still just learning how to draw, but I love expressing myself through writing. It's therapeutic and helps me sort out my feelings. Though, I've been a bit frustrated lately with my new phone. Its navigation app keeps malfunctioning, making getting around a bit of a challenge."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-1151cb366632375c3c0523c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.511053+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1151cb366632375c3c0523c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1151cb366632375c3c0523c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Cool, Sam! Writing is a great way to express yourself. What kind of writing do you enjoy? And about the phone, I recommend trying to update it, it usually works for me!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-6fb0d0e0a50f6da9a7bf26c1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.541672+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6fb0d0e0a50f6da9a7bf26c1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6fb0d0e0a50f6da9a7bf26c1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks for the tip, Evan! Writing in my journal and doing creative writing is a good way for me to express my innermost thoughts and feelings."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-66702d0f2f6d479cba918800", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.563182+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66702d0f2f6d479cba918800", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66702d0f2f6d479cba918800", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It can be super therapeutic. It gives you a place to express yourself. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-a04b64d47acb0911aad46c53", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.587716+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a04b64d47acb0911aad46c53", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a04b64d47acb0911aad46c53", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! It really helps me make sense of things and express my feelings. It's like having a conversation with myself."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-5797992c7ad5866b2433cc6a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.607328+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5797992c7ad5866b2433cc6a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5797992c7ad5866b2433cc6a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Gotcha, it's like having a place to figure stuff out and make sense of it all. We all need an outlet to express our thoughts and feelings."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-49/session_11-5c7e3f1538cb34e02c26fff6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:58:54.633508+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5c7e3f1538cb34e02c26fff6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5c7e3f1538cb34e02c26fff6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
